7a0a&_nc_ohc=StPfjLurTmUQ7kNvwHAPfAA&_nc_oc=Adobfdj60Qex8WJxPW8olRe_06ALD9uXVTX33StVb_weCWc5yFP9YvgDu8Q4FfH7W24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuYjD5Z0ixidxgNT3aJebvU0_jn4Lthe8aUPb014i6Vw&oe=6B031663"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2GxfSglqpRYQ7kNvwFU9aSC&_nc_oc=AdoTWW8N-s_NtWtprz8xuqMqdcnQXYCXptPBFTmr6oKNOGO52OjQD6nMzYbTfOfF3mE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSMC11ILurY3in5HWDEyQSOweIQSbqLe3AlzyZqCy28UA&oe=6B031C7B"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_descriptio